      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "Concept and approach ACK.\n\nNumbers make sense given that `IsFullyValid()` point validation dominates the standard paths. In `P2PKH_WorstCase`, hoisting `pubkey_candidate` outside the while loop in `GetPubKeyFromInput` would save ~290 heap reallocations across the dummy pushes.\n\nIt might also be worth adding `P2TR_ScriptPath` and `P2TR_ScriptPath_NUMS` to benchmark the control-block validation and the early rejection path.\n",
