      "message": "bench: add benchmarks for BIP-352 pubkey extraction (standard inputs)\n\nBenchmark the public key extraction (`GetPubKeyFromInput`) for the\nstandard shape of each Silent Payments eligible input type, i.e.\nP2PKH, P2SH-P2WPKH, P2WPKH and P2TR. For P2TR, a script-path spend is\nused, as it runs all of the key-path extraction logic plus the control\nblock checks and the NUMS-H internal key comparison.",
