      "message": "bench: add worst-case P2PKH benchmark for BIP-352 pubkey extraction\n\nAdd a P2PKH input with a malleated scriptSig that prepends as many\n33-byte pushes as the consensus scriptSig size limit (MAX_SCRIPT_SIZE)\nallows, each of which has to be hashed during the scan, followed by the\nactual signature and public key. The input respects all other consensus\nlimits (data pushes don't count towards MAX_OPS_PER_SCRIPT, the stack\nstays below MAX_STACK_SIZE), but is non-standard as it exceeds\nMAX_STANDARD_SCRIPTSIG_SIZE.\n\nResults on my arm64 machine:\n```\n$ ./build/bin/bench_bitcoin -filter='BIP352_.*'\n[...]\n\n|            ns/input |             input/s |    err% |     total | benchmark\n|--------------------:|--------------------:|--------:|----------:|:----------\n|            3,021.72 |          330,937.16 |    0.1% |      0.01 | `BIP352_GetPubKey_P2PKH`\n|           69,754.07 |           14,336.08 |    0.1% |      0.01 | `BIP352_GetPubKey_P2PKH_WorstCase`\n|            2,839.92 |          352,122.64 |    0.2% |      0.01 | `BIP352_GetPubKey_P2SH_P2WPKH`\n|            2,756.93 |          362,722.60 |    0.1% |      0.01 | `BIP352_GetPubKey_P2TR`\n|            2,752.45 |          363,312.34 |    0.0% |      0.01 | `BIP352_GetPubKey_P2WPKH`\n\n```",
